{
  "name": "turtle",
  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-05, docs/engines.md 'the sculpt overlay'): a red-eared slider 27 cm long -- a domed carapace (height ~ a third of its length) of raised scutes, five vertebrals and four costals a side, each with a yellow streak, the dark seams showing between them, a rim of marginals flaring a little at the back; the flat pale plastron and bridge under it; a green head with yellow stripes running down the neck and the red patch behind the eye, a hooked beak; scaly fore legs with five claws, columnar hind legs on flat feet, a short pointed tail SHARP PASS 2 (2026-11-08): the pointed parts -- clawF, clawH, hook (10 in all) -- are the engine's sharp `horn`s (sharp.js), made from the field shapes they replaced by tools/creaturegen/sharp/ (claws.py, teeth.py, spikes.py, antlers.py, bills.py): rooted in the body, tips pointed; RE-RUN those after this species' generator. (2026-11-08, review.py: claws) The claws RE-ROOTED (review.py): each a sheath as wide as the claw where it leaves the toe, sunk in it, the join faired (horn `fair`: grown out of the skin in its paint), darker at the base fading to its own colour at the point -- no pale cut edge where it leaves the fur.",
